# VS Code REST Client拡張用。curlだけで確認する場合はcurlメモ.txtを参照。
@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### Repositoryの入口
GET {{base}}
Accept: application/hal+json

### 一覧（第10章のpage=1に相当）
GET {{base}}/employees?page=0&size=5&sort=employeeId,asc

### 部署と職種
GET {{base}}/departments?sort=departmentId,asc

###
GET {{base}}/jobs?sort=grade,asc

### 検索リソースの一覧
GET {{base}}/employees/search

###
GET {{base}}/employees/search/by-salary?lowerSalary=500000&sort=employeeId,asc

###
GET {{base}}/employees/search/by-department?departmentId=2&sort=employeeId,asc

###
GET {{base}}/employees/search/by-job?jobId=1&sort=employeeId,asc

###
GET {{base}}/employees/search/by-name?keyword=山田

### Projection（月給・入社日を省略）
GET {{base}}/employees?projection=summary&sort=employeeId,asc

### 入力検証エラー（400）
POST {{base}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"employeeName":"", "salary":-1}

### 登録。LocationとETagを確認する
# @name create
POST {{base}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "新入 社員",
  "departmentId": 2,
  "jobId": 1,
  "salary": 300000,
  "entranceDate": "2026-04-01"
}

### 直前に作った社員を取得（GETを実行してから次のPUTへ）
# @name current
GET {{create.response.headers.Location}}

### 取得したETagで全項目更新
# @name replace
PUT {{create.response.headers.Location}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{current.response.headers.ETag}}

{
  "employeeName": "更新 社員",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "jobId": 2,
  "salary": 380000,
  "entranceDate": "2026-04-01"
}

### 古いETagで更新すると412（currentのGETを実行し直さずに送る）
PATCH {{create.response.headers.Location}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{current.response.headers.ETag}}

{"salary": 390000}

### 最新のETagなら部分更新できる
# @name patch
PATCH {{create.response.headers.Location}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{replace.response.headers.ETag}}

{"salary": 400000}

### 未変更なら304
GET {{create.response.headers.Location}}
If-None-Match: {{patch.response.headers.ETag}}

### 論理削除（204）
DELETE {{create.response.headers.Location}}
If-Match: {{patch.response.headers.ETag}}

### 削除済みは404
GET {{create.response.headers.Location}}

### マスターは参照専用（405）
DELETE {{base}}/departments/1

### 内部検索は非公開（404）
GET {{base}}/employees/search/findByStatus?status=active
